ring herself to ask the boy next to her to let her see his, and she doesn't have friends in other classes to borrow one from. She tries to erase her presence and go unnoticed, but the teacher spots her easily. Ruing her luck, Tomoko starts home in the rain, but another tragedy awaits as she stands over a flooded channel, watching the water lapping at the bottom of the bridge...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rbbHzttKjCMpTULuupIsLauIu79.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"It's a very rainy, windy day. Tomoko forgets her textbook, but she can't bring herself to ask the boy next to her to let her see his, and she doesn't have friends in other classes to borrow one from. She tries to erase her presence and go unnoticed, but the teacher spots her easily. Ruing her luck, Tomoko starts home in the rain, but another tragedy awaits as she stands over a flooded channel, watching the water lapping at the bottom of the bridge...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rbbHzttKjCMpTULuupIsLauIu79.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"9582","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"16742","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"16742","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"61755","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"270062","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"28832","synopsis":"Tomoko reads on the internet that sleeping on one's stomach can lead to sexual dreams, so she immediately tries it, but has nothing but nightmares. The next day in class, a sleep-deprived Tomoko overhears some girls talking about being molested on a train. Tomoko begins to wonder why she never gets molested and calls her friend Yuu-chan to ask if it's ever happened to her...","thumbnail":"https://image.tm